# Task 147-010: ScopeCollisionMonitor Execution Plan

## Approach
1. Create src/nervous/detectors/scope-collision.ts (~180 LoC)
   - Class: ScopeCollisionMonitor with detect(ctx: DetectorContext): DetectorResult | null
   - Guard: only trigger in PLAN or EXECUTE phases
   - Read .tasks/*.json files and check overlapping filesWrite
   - Normalize file paths (lowercase, collapse // to /)
   - Build writeMap: file → taskIds[]
   - Collisions = entries with >1 taskId
   - Return DetectorResult with SCOPE_COLLISION_REORDER action

2. Create tests/nervous/detectors/scope-collision.test.ts (5 tests)
   - Test 1: empty .tasks dir → null
   - Test 2: 1 task with 1 file, no other tasks → null (no collision)
   - Test 3: 2 tasks same file → DetectorResult with collision payload
   - Test 4: 3 tasks (A+B share file1, A+C share file2) → 2 collisions
   - Test 5: RETRO/CLEANUP phase → null (only PLAN/EXECUTE)

## Files to modify
- src/nervous/detectors/scope-collision.ts (NEW)
- tests/nervous/detectors/scope-collision.test.ts (NEW)

